WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.000 line:73%
Umuulan. May silbi
pa ba ang solar mo?

c02
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:06.220 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:08.850 line:73%
Oo, pero mas
mahina ang output.

c04
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.750 line:73%
Kapag maulap, nababawasan
ang liwanag sa panels.

c05
00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:16.540 line:73%
Kaya bumababa ang output,
minsan malaki ang bawas.

c06
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:20.310 line:73%
Pero madalas hindi zero, dahil
may diffuse light pa rin.

c07
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:26.160 line:73%
Ang tamang tingin: kWh sa
buong buwan, hindi isang araw.

cz1
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:32.570 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.100 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
